# Built on request by `pnpm maps` and `pnpm roughness`: the seen maps from 2K up and every 8K. The whole maps to 4K stay in
# git, since the site's figures need them and `pnpm dev` should show them without `pnpm assets`; the npm package ships only
# the seen 512 and 1K (see `files` in package.json).
moon-*-seen-2k.webp
moon-*-seen-4k.webp
moon-*-8k.webp
